~D. A spelling error.#Incorrect. That weakens conventions. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
}

::CW_U05_L02_Q09::[MLA.CW.REV.02] Which problem is a clarity issue?{
~A. A word is spelled correctly.#Incorrect. Correct spelling is not a problem. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
