~D. A pronoun clearly refers to Mara.#Incorrect. That is not a problem. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
}

::CW_U05_L02_Q11::[MLA.CW.REV.02] Which problem is a conventions issue?{
~A. A scene needs more motivation.#Incorrect. That is meaning/development. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
